  "scientific_review": [
    "All32 predeclared source section/date cases retained for NCC and Tsushima on four quarterly2022dates. Both native section orientations,components,coordinates,indices,hyperslabs,timestamps,metadata,nulls,all candidate scores/local maxima and selected5/10/20cm/s layers remain exact cloud output. No unsuccessful,edge or censored case is omitted.",
